00:08:48,100 --> 00:08:52,140
我每次去找我的医生看病  他都叫很多其他医生进来看我
Whenever I see mine he calls in a bunch of other doctors to have a look.

157
00:08:55,230 --> 00:08:57,320
她不是那种医生
She's not that kind of doctor.

158
00:08:58,070 --> 00:08:59,230
那是她的损失
Well, her loss.

159
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:02,400
人称真医学奇葩就是我
I've been called a genuine medical oddity.

160
00:09:08,330 --> 00:09:10,540
其实我本来是想毛遂自荐
Actually, I was going to suggest me.

161
00:09:10,700 --> 00:09:13,160
太好了  谁都比那谁强
Great. Anybody's better than, mmm.

162
00:09:15,500 --> 00:09:19,500
不好意思  他们只取走了我的脾脏和胆囊  我的情感还在
Excuse me. They took out my spleen and gallbladder,not my feelings.

163
00:09:28,180 --> 00:09:31,140
-诺维茨基博士 很高兴见到你   -我也是
-Dr. Nowitzki. Good to see you.  - Good to see you, too.

164
00:09:31,310 --> 00:09:32,520
我能和你一起坐吗
May I join you?

165
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:33,980
不能
No.

166
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:38,690
很高兴见到你
Good to see you.

167
00:09:41,860 --> 00:09:44,240
我们应该打给吉尼斯  那可能破了被拒绝速度的记录
We should call Guinness, that might be a record.

168
00:09:45,490 --> 00:09:49,490
她一看就是正在吃工作午餐  不希望被打扰
She's clearly having a working lunch and preferred to eat alone.

169
00:09:50,450 --> 00:09:52,450
库珀博士  这边
Dr. Cooper, over here.

170
00:09:54,370 --> 00:09:56,710
我本来可以让她很开心的
I could have made her very happy.

171
00:09:58,210 --> 00:10:00,300
你乖乖走开  我想她应该开心了
You kept walking. I think you did.

172
00:10:03,670 --> 00:10:05,260
你真觉得我们有理由担心吗
Do you really think there's reason to worry?

173
00:10:05,430 --> 00:10:07,590
是啊  她绝对在倒追谢尔顿
Yeah, she's definitely going after Sheldon.

174
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:09,600
我勾引过她  但她拒绝我了
I made a play for her and she shot me down.

175
00:10:09,760 --> 00:10:11,720
可那根本证明不了什么
All right, well, that doesn't prove anything.

176
00:10:11,890 --> 00:10:15,390
是啊  女人有一百万个拒绝拉杰的原因
Yeah, there's a million reasons a woman would shoot Raj down.

177
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:18,900
真的吗  一百万个那么夸张
Like, really, a million?

178
00:10:19,060 --> 00:10:20,060
好吧  几百个
Fine, hundreds.

179
00:10:20,230 --> 00:10:21,570
谢谢
Thank you.

180
00:10:22,570 --> 00:10:26,070
重点是  这可能根本没什么  我们都反应过度了
The point is this could be nothing and we are all overreacting.

181
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:30,070
大家好  这位是我朋友 诺维茨基博士
Hey, everybody. This is my friend, Dr. Nowitzki.

182
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:31,410
大家好
Hi.

183
00:10:31,580 --> 00:10:32,660
你好
Hi.

184
00:10:34,620 --> 00:10:36,750
我们刚去游泳了
We just went swimming.

185
00:10:43,380 --> 00:10:44,920
你真的进泳池里了吗
And you actually got in a pool?

186
00:10:45,590 --> 00:10:46,670
我一开始怕得要死
I was scared,

187
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:50,300
但我告诉自己  这只是个大浴缸
but I told myself it's just a big bathtub.

188
00:10:51,470 --> 00:10:54,520
然后我再度怕得要死  因为我浴缸里有很多陌生人
Then I got scared again 'cause there are all these strangers in my bathtub.

189
00:10:55,730 --> 00:10:56,770
我为他感到骄傲
I was proud of him

190
00:10:56,930 --> 00:10:59,600
很多人第一天都不敢把脸埋进水里
a lot of people don't put their face in the water on the first day.

191
00:10:59,770 --> 00:11:02,270
我是为了躲避一只蜜蜂  但那也算数
Well, I was hiding from a bee, but it still counts.

192
00:11:04,780 --> 00:11:06,740
麻烦让个位子给我
Can I just squeeze in here?

193
00:11:10,740 --> 00:11:12,660
谢尔顿  你跟艾米联系过了吗
So, Sheldon, have you talked to Amy?

194
00:11:12,830 --> 00:11:13,950
有啊  我们今早视频聊天了
Yes, we Skyped this morning

195
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:15,870
我睡前会再跟她联系一次
and I'm sure I'll check in with her before I go to sleep.

196
00:11:16,040 --> 00:11:17,790
谢尔顿总说起她
Sheldon talks about her all the time.

197
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:19,120
我等不及见她了
I can't wait to meet her.

198
00:11:19,290 --> 00:11:20,290
真的
That is true.

199
00:11:20,460 --> 00:11:23,290
她一直在问艾米会离开多久
She keeps asking how long Amy's going to be gone.

200
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:29,380
拉蒙娜  自我介绍一下吧  你有男朋友吗
Uh, so, Ramona, tell us about yourself. Do you, do you have a boyfriend?

201
00:11:29,630 --> 00:11:33,550
莱纳德  你老婆就坐在旁边  你干嘛呢
Leonard, your wife is sitting right here. What are you doing?

202
00:11:36,310 --> 00:11:38,770
我的工作很忙  没什么时间谈恋爱
No, my work doesn't leave me a lot of time for relationships.

203
00:11:38,940 --> 00:11:41,100
这一点你已经表达得很清楚了
I think you made that very clear.

204
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:44,900
她曾是欧洲核子研究中心美国团队的一员
She was part of the American team at CERN.

205
00:11:45,070 --> 00:11:47,650
他们探测到希格斯玻色子时  我就在现场
I had a front row seat when they detected the Higgs boson.

206
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:51,200
你知道吗  我和彼得·希格斯通过信
Do you know, I've corresponded with Peter Higgs.

207
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:51,200
英国理论物理学家  提出了希格斯机制  曾获诺贝尔物理学奖

208
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:52,660
你想看看他的信吗
Would you like to see some of his letters?

209
00:11:52,820 --> 00:11:54,660
-当然了  -我去拿
- Absolutely. - I'll get them.

210
00:11:54,990 --> 00:11:57,160
等等  我跟你一起去
Well, hang on, I'll come with you.

211
00:11:57,580 --> 00:11:59,500
真好玩  像玩耍约会一样
Oh, fun. Like a play date.

212
00:12:02,830 --> 00:12:03,840
如果我说错了  纠正我
Okay, correct me if I'm wrong,

213
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:07,050
但我们不是该阻止这种事的发生吗
but isn't that exactly what we were supposed to stop from happening?

214
00:12:08,460 --> 00:12:09,510
我都舍身用肉体隔开他们了
I threw my body at them,

215
00:12:09,670 --> 00:12:11,680
你还想要我怎么样
what else did you want me to do?

216
00:12:13,680 --> 00:12:15,010
你觉得该打电话给艾米吗
You think you should call Amy?

217
00:12:15,180 --> 00:12:17,180
你有手有嘴  你打啊
You got fingers and a mouth, you call her.

218
00:12:20,890 --> 00:12:22,310
你看
Here you go.

219
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:24,520
这些信都是彼得·希格斯写给你的吗
Are these all from Peter Higgs?

220
00:12:24,690 --> 00:12:26,610
不不不  有很多不同的名人
Oh, no, no, no. They're from many famous people.

221
00:12:27,020 --> 00:12:29,400
看到没  比如这封信来自帕特里克·斯图尔特
See? Oh, like this one. This is from Patrick Stewart.

222
00:12:27,020 --> 00:12:29,400
英国演员  出演过《X战警》X教授一角

223
00:12:29,570 --> 00:12:34,160
信上说  如果我再去他家  他就会放狗来跟我"会一会"
It says if I come to his house again,I get to meet his dogs.

224
00:12:38,290 --> 00:12:39,620
不好意思
Oh, excuse me.

225
00:12:42,670 --> 00:12:44,500
-你好  谢尔顿  -你好  艾米
- Hello, Sheldon. - Oh, hello, Amy.

226
00:12:45,330 --> 00:12:47,000
我又想你了
I was missing you again.

227
00:12:47,170 --> 00:12:50,130
我也想你  时机正好
I miss you, too. Hey, this is good timing.

228
00:12:50,300 --> 00:12:52,840
还记得我之前跟你提过的诺维茨基博士吗
Remember that Dr. Nowitzki I told you about?

229
00:12:53,010 --> 00:12:54,340
她就在这儿呢
She's right here.

230
00:12:55,800 --> 00:12:57,180
她什么
Sh-she's what?

231
00:12:59,430 --> 00:13:00,430
你好
Hello.

232
00:13:01,520 --> 00:13:02,560
你好
Hi.

233
00:13:02,980 --> 00:13:04,400
幸会
So nice to meet you.

234
00:13:09,400 --> 00:13:11,900
稍等  喂
Hang on. Hello.

235
00:13:13,400 --> 00:13:15,200
有点迟了  莱纳德
A little late, Leonard.

236
00:13:16,700 --> 00:13:17,740
对不起
I'm sorry.

237
00:13:17,910 --> 00:13:20,080
莱纳德这个时候打电话给你做什么
What is Leonard doing calling you at this hour?

238
00:13:20,790 --> 00:13:22,250
这不重要
It's not important.

239
00:13:22,660 --> 00:13:26,130
我得跟你说  这样似乎有点不合适
I must tell you, that seems a little inappropriate.

240
00:13:26,290 --> 00:13:28,210
-你同意吗  -同意
-Don't you agree?  -I do.

241
00:13:28,380 --> 00:13:29,750
瞧
See?

242
00:13:29,920 --> 00:13:31,760
我们都这样认为
We both think so.

243
00:13:34,430 --> 00:13:37,090
好了  我快疯了  你们谁过去一下
All right, this is making me crazy. Somebody's got to go over there.

244
00:13:37,600 --> 00:13:39,760
你有腿有脚  你去啊
You got feet and legs, you do it.

245
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:43,600
你要和我一起去吗
Will you go with me?

246
00:13:43,770 --> 00:13:46,600
去了做什么  冲他们摇硬币罐吗
To do what? Shake a can of nickels at them?

247
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:50,020
我们太杞人忧天了
We're being ridiculous.

248
00:13:50,190 --> 00:13:54,570
那么漂亮的女人是不可能试图勾引谢尔顿·库珀的
There's no way a woman that attractive is trying to seduce Sheldon Cooper.

249
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:58,950
你的自我安慰牌打完了没
You done trying to make yourself feel better?

250
00:13:59,620 --> 00:14:02,120
没  我还没打种族歧视牌呢
No. I haven't played the race card yet.

251
00:14:04,790 --> 00:14:06,960
我也不想打断聚会
Hey, I hate to break up the party,

252
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:10,420
但艾米说我累了  必须上床睡觉
but Amy says I'm tired and have to go to bed.

253
00:14:12,590 --> 00:14:14,760
很高兴见到大家  多谢你们的晚餐
It was nice seeing everybody.Thank you for dinner.

254
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:16,010
-不客气  -我们的荣幸
- Sure. - Our pleasure.

255
00:14:16,180 --> 00:14:17,390
随便啦
Whatever.

256
00:14:19,430 --> 00:14:21,310
-要送我上车吗  -当然
-Walk me to my car?  -Of course.

257
00:14:21,640 --> 00:14:23,100
我们一起送
We'll all go.

258
00:14:39,660 --> 00:14:40,830
借过
Excuse me.

259
00:14:52,500 --> 00:14:54,380
不好意思  我过去下  好了
Pardon. I just need to... yeah.

260
00:15:05,140 --> 00:15:07,640
真好玩  像玩"马里奥赛车"
That was fun. It was like Mario Kart.

261
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:13,440
拜
Bye.

262
00:15:14,530 --> 00:15:15,650
我们需要谈谈
We need to talk.

263
00:15:16,280 --> 00:15:19,070
是关于莱纳德和艾米的事吗  我也不爽
Wh-- Is this about Leonard and Amy? I don't like it either.

264
00:15:23,030 --> 00:15:25,540
我知道你在女人方面经验不足
Okay, I know you don't have a lot of experience with women,

265
00:15:25,700 --> 00:15:28,660
但拉蒙娜似乎对你有意思
but Ramona seems to have a romantic interest in you.

266
00:15:29,420 --> 00:15:32,170
这根本没道理  她知道我有女朋友
That doesn't make any sense. She knows I have a girlfriend.

267
00:15:32,340 --> 00:15:34,380
有时候女人不在乎
Well, sometimes women don't care.

268
00:15:34,550 --> 00:15:36,380
有时候这令她们更想要这个男人
Sometimes it makes them want a guy even more.

269
00:15:38,050 --> 00:15:41,140
可能是这样  但诺维茨基博士只是朋友
That may be true,but Dr. Nowitzki's just a friend.

270
00:15:41,300 --> 00:15:43,640
事实上  如果她没穿那件突显
In fact, I wouldn't have even noticed she's a woman

271
00:15:43,800 --> 00:15:46,930
她胸部的泳衣的话  我都没注意到她是女人
if she hadn't worn that bathing suit that highlighted her bosom.

272
00:15:50,520 --> 00:15:52,520
好吧  我们换个说法
Okay. Um... ...let's try this.

273
00:15:52,690 --> 00:15:56,820
把你自己想象成那种喜欢收集限量版玩具公仔的人
Think of yourself as one of those limited edition toys people like to collect.

274
00:15:58,030 --> 00:15:59,360
我一直是这样想的
I already do.

275
00:16:01,660 --> 00:16:02,950
那你就会明白了
Well, then you get it.

276
00:16:03,570 --> 00:16:06,910
因为我是独一无二的  我更有价值
Because there's only one of me,I'm more valuable.

277
00:16:07,080 --> 00:16:08,250
对啊
Right.

278
00:16:08,540 --> 00:16:09,580
不过
Although,

279
00:16:09,750 --> 00:16:13,460
艾米已经把我从包装盒中拿出来玩过了  我掉价了
Amy's already taken me out of my package and played with me.

280
00:16:17,420 --> 00:16:19,840
别管玩具这个比喻了  也许
Let's forget the toy thing, okay? Um, maybe...

281
00:16:20,010 --> 00:16:24,390
佩妮  感谢你的关心  但我不觉得事情是这样的
Penny, look. I appreciate your concern,but I don't think that's what's happening.

282
00:16:24,930 --> 00:16:27,260
好吧  你觉得事情是怎样的
All right. What do you think is happening?

283
00:16:27,850 --> 00:16:30,350
我觉得诺维茨基博士是一位友好的同事
I think Dr. Nowitzki is a friendly colleague.

284
00:16:31,100 --> 00:16:34,110
我觉得你和莱纳德需要见婚姻咨询师
I think you and Leonard need to see a marriage counselor.

285
00:16:35,690 --> 00:16:39,530
我需要去更新简历加上游泳这项特殊技能
And I need to update my resume to include swimming as a special skill.

286
00:16:47,910 --> 00:16:50,370
别这样看着我  我尽力了
Don't look at me like that, I tried.

287
00:16:58,460 --> 00:16:59,670
你吃了吗
Hey, did you eat yet?

288
00:17:00,300 --> 00:17:02,050
吃了早餐  没吃中餐
Uh, breakfast yes, lunch no.

289
00:17:02,220 --> 00:17:03,430
我服用了止咳糖
I did have a cough drop,

290
00:17:03,590 --> 00:17:06,800
但这是介于吸和吃之间的行为
but that really rides the line between sucking and eating.

291
00:17:07,970 --> 00:17:09,600
太好了  我给咱俩做了三明治
Well, perfect. I made us sandwiches.

292
00:17:09,770 --> 00:17:11,310
真是周到
How thoughtful.

293
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:13,520
-谢谢你  -没什么
-Thank you.  -No big deal,

294
00:17:13,690 --> 00:17:15,350
我喜欢和你在一起
I enjoy spending time with you.

295
00:17:15,520 --> 00:17:17,230
我也是
And I with you.

296
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:19,530
问一下
Question:

297
00:17:20,320 --> 00:17:23,110
你是想和我发展恋爱关系吗
are you seeking a romantic relationship with me?

298
00:17:24,700 --> 00:17:25,820
如果我是呢
What if I were?

299
00:17:26,870 --> 00:17:29,120
这会引起一系列的问题
Well, that would raise a number of problems.

300
00:17:29,290 --> 00:17:31,830
我们是同事  我现在有女友
We're colleagues.I'm currently in a relation...

301
00:17:41,010 --> 00:17:42,340
恕我失陪一下
Excuse me a moment.

302
00:18:42,320 --> 00:18:45,530
艾米  艾米  艾米
Amy. Amy. Amy.

303
00:19:03,050 --> 00:19:04,210
你愿意嫁给我吗
Will you marry me?

